{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/869109e4385e4bbbb9fd6ec304ec1719.webp?t=1770920957\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a speedy rover exploring infected planets. Dig through alien terrain, fight hostile creatures, extract resources and return to base before your energy runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run pushes you deeper into a spreading alien infestation. The more you risk, the more you gain, but staying too long can cost everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/dadfc4ca4010f448c763f5d476e44e06.poster.avif?t=1770920957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/dadfc4ca4010f448c763f5d476e44e06.webm?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/dadfc4ca4010f448c763f5d476e44e06.mp4?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile creatures emerge from the planet itself. Combat is fast and forces you to constantly react to the world around you. Every planet becomes more dangerous the deeper the infection spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/cbd6f8e8b9716c7c6dd465dbecb1bd80.poster.avif?t=1770920957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/cbd6f8e8b9716c7c6dd465dbecb1bd80.webm?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/cbd6f8e8b9716c7c6dd465dbecb1bd80.mp4?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is controlled by a central core. Finding it means pushing through harder terrain and stronger enemies. Removing the core can stop the infection, but triggers aggressive reactions from the planet\u2019s inhabitants. Your decisions shape how the infection spreads across the overworld.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/2be9e46e86ad1513efed9a68c66467f0.poster.avif?t=1770920957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/2be9e46e86ad1513efed9a68c66467f0.webm?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/2be9e46e86ad1513efed9a68c66467f0.mp4?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine different ores to fuel your progress. Resources are limited. You must decide when to push deeper and when to return to base before running out of energy or losing everything. Risk and reward are always in tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/ffeda15246e0b4296948da9c8f7e5611.poster.avif?t=1770920957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/ffeda15246e0b4296948da9c8f7e5611.webm?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/ffeda15246e0b4296948da9c8f7e5611.mp4?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use extracted resources to upgrade your rover. Improve weapons, abilities and energy management to adapt your playstyle. Each run allows new builds and strategies, preparing you for more dangerous planets and deeper infection levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-Roguelike with a strong focus on mining and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated planets with increasing infection levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy-based risk system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular upgrades and build variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic overworld where infection spreads between planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art with high-contrast visual design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304080?t=1770920957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304080?t=1770920957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/cf5e3db06cb92ddf6290f71f8a894466a56b5e12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770920957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/cf5e3db06cb92ddf6290f71f8a894466a56b5e12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770920957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class