04080/extras/ffeda15246e0b4296948da9c8f7e5611.mp4?t=1770920957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use extracted resources to upgrade your rover. Improve weapons, abilities and energy management to adapt your playstyle. Each run allows new builds and strategies, preparing you for more dangerous planets and deeper infection levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-Roguelike with a strong focus on mining and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated planets with increasing infection levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy-based risk system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular upgrades and build variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic overworld where infection spreads between planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art with high-contrast visual design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Level Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/3b6f287f11783dd2078d4295b950e0e943552d15/header.jpg?t=1770920957","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304080/1672382051/e8e0f5ac97d43c62e5feef82c0e3a1e60926f5d7/1770919219/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770919762","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304080/1672382051/e8e0f5ac97d43c62e